# Optional. Serve the heavy files (/models, /ort) from a CDN instead of your app host.
# The CDN must send CORS headers (Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *) and serve the same paths:
#   https://cdn.example.com/models/*.onnx   https://cdn.example.com/ort/*
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSET_BASE=https://cdn.example.com

# Optional. Compact (int8) face and colour engines, hosted by you. See src/lib/ai/registry.ts.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MODEL_BASE=https://cdn.example.com/engines
